{"subjectId":"data-science","id":"scraping-basics","title":"requests & BeautifulSoup","group":"Web Scraping","order":7,"html":"<p class=\"lead\">Web scraping = download a page's HTML (<code>requests</code>), then pick out the data you need (<code>BeautifulSoup</code>). It's how you build datasets that don't come as a CSV.</p>\n<div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">1</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-title\">Request</div><div class=\"step-desc\"><code>requests.get(url, headers=…)</code> downloads the page.</div></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">2</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-title\">Parse</div><div class=\"step-desc\"><code>BeautifulSoup(html, \"html.parser\")</code> turns HTML text into a searchable tree.</div></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">3</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-title\">Extract</div><div class=\"step-desc\"><code>find</code> / <code>find_all</code> / <code>select</code> locate elements; <code>.text</code> and <code>.get(\"href\")</code> read them.</div></div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">4</div><div class=\"step-body\"><div class=\"step-title\">Store</div><div class=\"step-desc\">Collect rows in a list, then save with pandas (<code>to_csv</code>).</div></div></div>\n<section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-download\"></i>1. Download the page</h3>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>import requests\n\nheaders = {\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; LearnViaNotesBot/1.0)\"}\nr = requests.get(\"https://quotes.toscrape.com/page/1/\", headers=headers, timeout=10)\nprint(r.status_code)          # 200 means OK; 404 not found, 403 forbidden, 429 too many requests\nhtml = r.text                 # decoded text (r.content is the raw bytes)</code></pre></figure>\n<div class=\"callout callout--note\"><div class=\"callout-label\">Key point</div><p>Some sites reject requests without a browser-like <code>User-Agent</code> header — that's why the notebook sets one. Always pass a <code>timeout</code> so a slow site can't hang your script.</p></div>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-code\"></i>2. Parse and extract</h3>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>html = \"\"\"\n&lt;div class=\"quote\"&gt;\n  &lt;span class=\"text\"&gt;“The world as we have created it is a process of our thinking.”&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;small class=\"author\"&gt;Albert Einstein&lt;/small&gt; &lt;a href=\"/author/Albert-Einstein\"&gt;(about)&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a class=\"tag\" href=\"/tag/change/\"&gt;change&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=\"tag\" href=\"/tag/thinking/\"&gt;thinking&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=\"quote\"&gt;\n  &lt;span class=\"text\"&gt;“It is our choices that show what we truly are.”&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;small class=\"author\"&gt;J.K. Rowling&lt;/small&gt; &lt;a href=\"/author/J-K-Rowling\"&gt;(about)&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a class=\"tag\" href=\"/tag/choices/\"&gt;choices&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom bs4 import BeautifulSoup\nsoup = BeautifulSoup(html, \"html.parser\")\n\nfirst = soup.find(\"div\", class_=\"quote\")                      # first match (or None)\nprint(first.find(\"small\", class_=\"author\").text)              # Albert Einstein\n\nfor q in soup.find_all(\"div\", class_=\"quote\"):                # every match\n    text = q.find(\"span\", class_=\"text\").text.strip(\"“”\")\n    tags = [t.text for t in q.find_all(\"a\", class_=\"tag\")]\n    print(text[:22], \"|\", \", \".join(tags))</code></pre></figure>\n<figure class=\"code\"><figcaption>Output</figcaption><pre><code>Albert Einstein\nThe world as we have c | change, thinking\nIt is our choices that | choices</code></pre></figure>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Call</th><th>Returns</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>soup.find(tag, class_=…)</code></td><td>The first matching element, or <code>None</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>soup.find_all(tag, attrs={…})</code></td><td>A list of all matches</td></tr><tr><td><code>soup.select(\"div.quote span.text\")</code></td><td>Matches for a CSS selector</td></tr><tr><td><code>el.text</code> / <code>el.get_text(strip=True)</code></td><td>The element's text</td></tr><tr><td><code>el.get(\"href\")</code> / <code>el[\"href\"]</code></td><td>An attribute (<code>get</code> returns <code>None</code> if missing)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<figure data-lang=\"py\" class=\"code\"><figcaption>Python</figcaption><pre><code>html = \"\"\"\n&lt;div class=\"quote\"&gt;\n  &lt;span class=\"text\"&gt;“The world as we have created it is a process of our thinking.”&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;small class=\"author\"&gt;Albert Einstein&lt;/small&gt; &lt;a href=\"/author/Albert-Einstein\"&gt;(about)&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a class=\"tag\" href=\"/tag/change/\"&gt;change&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=\"tag\" href=\"/tag/thinking/\"&gt;thinking&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class=\"quote\"&gt;\n  &lt;span class=\"text\"&gt;“It is our choices that show what we truly are.”&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;small class=\"author\"&gt;J.K. Rowling&lt;/small&gt; &lt;a href=\"/author/J-K-Rowling\"&gt;(about)&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a class=\"tag\" href=\"/tag/choices/\"&gt;choices&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom bs4 import BeautifulSoup\nsoup = BeautifulSoup(html, \"html.parser\")\nprint([a.get(\"href\") for a in soup.select(\"div.quote &gt; a:not(.tag)\")])   # ['/author/Albert-Einstein', '/author/J-K-Rowling']\nprint(len(soup.select(\"a.tag\")))                                          # 3</code></pre></figure>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-settings\"></i>Parsers</h3>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Parser</th><th>Install</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>html.parser</code></td><td>Built in</td><td>Good default</td></tr><tr><td><code>lxml</code></td><td><code>pip install lxml</code></td><td>Fastest</td></tr><tr><td><code>html5lib</code></td><td><code>pip install html5lib</code></td><td>Most forgiving with broken HTML, slowest</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</section><section class=\"block\"><h3><i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\"></i>Scrape responsibly</h3>\n<div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"callout callout--good\"><div class=\"callout-label\">Do</div><p>Check the site's terms and <code>robots.txt</code>, identify yourself in the User-Agent, pause between requests (<code>time.sleep(1)</code>), and prefer an official API when there is one.</p></div><div class=\"callout callout--bad\"><div class=\"callout-label\">Avoid</div><p>Hammering a site with rapid requests, scraping personal data, or ignoring a site's terms — it can get you blocked or break the law.</p></div></div></section>"}